__NOTOC__
= Spell Icon Duplicates =

In the '''Default''' spell icon set, many <code>new_icon</code> ids render identical art: 130 of the 145 ids used by in-game spells collapse into the 19 groups below (the remaining 15 ids are unique). [[Icon_List]] shows one icon per group, labeled with the group's lowest id.

Spell pages always use the spell's '''true''' <code>new_icon</code>, not the group's lowest id: the in-game '''Alternate 1''' and '''Alternate 2''' icon sets (Options &rarr; Interface &rarr; General &rarr; Alternative Textures) assign distinct art to every id, so ids that look identical below are different icons for players using those sets. The duplication is a property of the Default skin only.

Each group shows every member id rendered from its own uploaded file, lowest (canonical) id first. Ids marked &asymp; are stored as slightly different image files that render the same art.

